# Downloaded package corpora, generated graph tensors, model checkpoints, and
# evaluation output. None of these belong in the public repository: they are
# large, third-party, or contain real malware samples.
#
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose: korvyr/data/ ships package data,
# and docs/results/ holds committed evaluation write-ups.
/data/
/checkpoints/
/models/
/results/
.eval_tmp/
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.tgz
*.tar.gz

